  "$comment": "Data-only spawn tables for an external PopulationSpawner (gameplay owns no spawn loop). biomes map names to worldgen tile ids. densityPerChunk = target live count per loaded chunk before weighting; phaseMul scales by day phase; biomeWeights (0 = never) scale by chunk biome; capPerChunk / globalCap per mode; group = pack size and spread in tiles. modes: which game modes enable the entry plus optional per-mode density multipliers. Zombie entries with fromZombies=true take phaseMul/cap from zombies.json spawning (reused, not duplicated).",
